{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19951","headline":"汝州南潭陪陆中丞公讌 · 孟郊","name":"汝州南潭陪陆中丞公讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一雨百泉涨，南潭夜来深。\n分明碧沙底，写出青天心。\n远客洞庭至，因兹涤烦襟。\n既登飞云舫，愿奏清风琴。\n高岸立旗戟，潜蛟失浮沈。\n威棱护斯浸，魍魉逃所侵。\n山态变初霁，水声流新音。\n耳目极眺听，潺湲与嶔岑。\n谁言柳太守，空有白苹吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}